MIT Media Lab compact KEMAR HRTF measurements
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Copyright 1994 MIT Media Laboratory.

Authors and measurement creators:

    Bill Gardner and Keith Martin
    MIT Media Lab
    "HRTF Measurements of a KEMAR Dummy-Head Microphone" (1994)

Source:

    https://sound.media.mit.edu/resources/KEMAR.html
    https://sound.media.mit.edu/resources/KEMAR/compact.zip

The source archive states that the data is provided free without restrictions
on use, provided that Gardner and Martin are cited when the data is used in a
research or commercial application.

The repository's `frontend/assets/mit-kemar.bhrtf` file is a converted runtime
representation of these measurements. Conversion and provenance details are in
`docs/mit-kemar.md`. The project's MIT License does not relicense this dataset.

