Pistachio's "2 Human Head Basemeshes"
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Creator: Pistachio
Asset: "2 Human Head Basemeshes" (male OBJ)
Source: https://opengameart.org/content/2-human-head-basemeshes
License: CC0 1.0 Universal
License text: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode

The repository copy is `crates/web/assets/head-male.obj`. It is modified at
build time through subdivision, trimming, alignment, triangulation, scaling,
and normal generation. Additional provenance and the source checksum are in
`docs/head-model.md`. CC0 does not require attribution; this notice is retained
for provenance.

